OL,3,GNEWSA'Special surprise' as rare moth
OL,4,Afound in nature reserve for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare species of moth has been found
OL,7,Fin north Wales.
OL,9,FThe Bog Grass Moth was found at Cors
OL,10,FGeirch National Nature Reserve on the
OL,11,FLlE7n Peninsula in Gwynedd, as
OL,12,Fconservationists were surveying the
OL,13,Farea's species.
OL,15,FExperts called it a "special surprise"
OL,16,Fto find the "incredibly sparse moth" in
OL,17,Fthe habitat.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
