OL,3,GNEWSA'Special surprise' as rare moth
OL,4,Afound in nature reserve for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exact population figure in the UK
OL,7,Ffor the Bog Grass Moth is not known,
OL,8,Fbut they have only been recorded in a
OL,9,Fsmall number of English counties, such
OL,10,Fas Dorset.
